WEBVTT

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.399
(man) Assemble on that bank!
在河边列队

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.944
You will not be harmed!
你们不会受到伤害

00:00:54.612 --> 00:00:56.948
Surrender your weapons!
放下你们的武器

00:00:57.782 --> 00:01:00.118
Take off the armor!
卸下盔甲

00:01:17.093 --> 00:01:20.680
Rise, kings and queens of Narnia.
起来 纳尼亚的王和女王们

00:01:24.309 --> 00:01:25.602
All of you.
你们全体

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:33.109
I do not think I am ready.
我不认为我有资格

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:36.487
It's for that very reason
I know you are.
正因你的谦逊
我知道你够资格

00:01:43.494 --> 00:01:47.540
(bagpipes playing)

00:02:19.822 --> 00:02:23.743
(gasping) Oh!

00:02:24.869 --> 00:02:27.580
Thank you, Your Majesty.
谢谢你 陛下

00:02:27.664 --> 00:02:29.749
Thank you.
谢谢你

00:02:29.832 --> 00:02:31.793
Uh... Oh!

00:02:31.876 --> 00:02:36.881
Hail, Aslan!
It is a great honor to be in...
万岁 亚斯蓝！
这真是至高无上的荣幸…

00:02:40.843 --> 00:02:43.513
I'm completely out of countenance.
我完全冷静不下来

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:48.017
I must crave your indulgence for
appearing in this unseemly fashion.
我得请求您谅解
我的样子如此不得体

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:51.396
Uh... perhaps a drop more?
也许再来一滴？

00:02:51.479 --> 00:02:54.524
- I don't think it does that.
- You could have a go.
我不认为那会有用
你可以试试

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:57.652
(Aslan laughs)
It becomes you well, small one.
你这样也很好 小家伙

00:02:57.735 --> 00:03:00.530
All the same, great king,
无所谓 伟大的王

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:06.077
I regret that I must withdraw, for a
tail is the honor and glory of a mouse.
我恐怕必需回避
因为尾巴是老鼠的荣耀

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.664
Perhaps you think too much
of your honor, friend.
也许你太在乎你的荣耀了

00:03:09.747 --> 00:03:14.585
Well, it's not just the honor.
It's also great for balance.
不止是荣耀
也是平衡的利器

00:03:14.669 --> 00:03:18.214
And climbing. And grabbing things.
还有攀爬 还有抓握东西

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:21.676
May it please Your High Majesty,
we will not bear the shame
如果这能使陛下满意
首领没尾巴

00:03:21.759 --> 00:03:24.721
of wearing an honor denied
to our chief.
我们就不要尾巴

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:28.224
(Aslan laughs) Not for
the sake of your dignity,
这不是为了你们的尊严

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:30.560
but for the love of your people.
这是为了你们之间的爱

00:03:34.063 --> 00:03:36.524
(all exclaiming, laughing)

00:03:36.607 --> 00:03:41.070
Look! Thank you, my liege.
I will treasure it always.
你们看！谢谢你 主上
我会永远珍惜它

00:03:41.154 --> 00:03:45.825
From this day forward it will serve as
a great reminder of my huge humility.
从今天起
它会成为我谦卑的象征

00:03:45.908 --> 00:03:47.869
(Aslan laughs)

00:03:47.952 --> 00:03:51.998
Now, where is this dear little friend
you've told me so much about?
你提过的亲爱的小朋友在哪？

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:11.100
(roaring)

00:04:12.143 --> 00:04:14.270
Do you see him now?
你现在看到他了吧？

00:04:22.737 --> 00:04:25.531
(cheering)

